In furtherance to our earlier intimation dated August 17, 2026, wherein the Company informed the Exchanges regarding the receipt of notice NSE/LIST-SOP/FINES/0904 from the National Stock Exchange of India Limited ("NSE") imposing a fine of ?2,000/- plus applicable GST (Total: ?2,360/-) for an alleged one-day delay in filing the Shareholding Pattern under Regulation 31 of SEBI (LODR) Regulations, 2015 for the quarter ended June 30, 2026, and the subsequent waiver application submitted by the Company;
We are pleased to inform you that the National Stock Exchange of India Limited ("NSE") vide its communication/letter reference no. NSE/LIST/CD/2026/0043 dated October 19, 2026, has communicated that the matter was placed before the Relevant Authority of the Exchange and the Company's request for waiver of fine has been considered favourably (approved/accepted).

Accordingly, the fine levied by the Exchange stands waived in full.
